# ${SRC_DIR}/middlewares/

Cross-cutting Express middleware for ${PROJECT_NAME}.

## What lives here

- [`errorHandler.ts`](errorHandler.ts) — terminal error handler. Always last in the chain.
- [`requestId.ts`](requestId.ts) — assigns a uuid per request, exposes it on `req.id`.
- [`validate.ts`](validate.ts) — zod validation factory for request body / query / params.

## What does NOT live here

- Feature-specific handlers — those live under `${SRC_DIR}/api/<version>/<feature>/controllers/`.
- Models or DB code — those live under `${SRC_DIR}/models/` and `${SRC_DIR}/config/`.

## Naming

- Lowercase camelCase, one middleware per file (`requestId.ts`, `errorHandler.ts`).
- The default export (or a named export matching the filename) is the middleware function.

